 * The operator schedules the cancellation on the provided {@link Scheduler},
 * which is the part we want to evaluate.</p>
 *
 * <p>Best‑practice JMH settings are used:
 * <ul>
 *   <li>Warm‑up iterations to let the JIT stabilize.</li>
 *   <li>Multiple measurement iterations.</li>
