 * internal overhead. The combiner simply creates an {@code Object[]} and returns the first
 * element to avoid extra computation that could mask the operator's cost.
 */
@BenchmarkMode(Mode.Throughput)
@OutputTimeUnit(TimeUnit.SECONDS)
@Warmup(iterations = 5, time = 1, timeUnit = TimeUnit.SECONDS)
